# OneDrive conflict copies. This repo lives inside OneDrive and is edited from
# two machines, so OneDrive occasionally drops a second copy of a file next to
# the original, named after whichever computer lost the race. Git is the source
# of truth, so these never belong in a commit.
*-NT-TRIGGS-PC.*
*-TONY-HOME.*
*-DESKTOP-*.*
*[Cc]onflicted copy*
*-Copy.*
